{"step": 128, "tokens": 2096128, "dev_nll": 2.7060106719688113, "arc": 18, "arc_preds": "ABABDAAAACADBCCBCCBB", "eval_s": 160.64055466651917, "generations": ["1. Assign specific cleaning tasks to each household member based on their schedule and preferences.\n2. Establish a daily routine where everyone washes their dishes immediately after use to prevent buildup.\n3. Keep a well-stocked supply of cleaning supplies and a shared chore chart visible in the kitchen.<|im_end|>", "To solve this, we can set up a simple system of equations. Let $c$ be the number of chickens and $r$ be the number of rabbits.\n\n1.  **Heads:** Each animal has 1 head.\n    $$c + r = 10$$\n2.  **Legs:** Chickens have 2 legs, and rabbits have 4 legs.\n    $$2c + 4r = 28$$\n\n**Step-by-step solution:**\n*   From the first equation, we know that $c = 10 - r$.\n*   Substitute this into", "```python\ndef is_balanced(text):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks whether parentheses are balanced in the given text,\n    ignoring all other characters.\n\n    Args:\n        text (str): The input string to check.\n\n    Returns:\n        bool: True if parentheses are balanced, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    stack = []\n    for char in text:\n        if char == '(':\n            stack.append(char)\n        elif char == ')':\n            if not stack:\n                return False\n            stack.pop()\n    return len(stack) == 0\n```\n\n### How", "\u0130\u015fte o c\u00fcmlenin daha resmi ve kurumsal bir T\u00fcrk\u00e7e kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131:\n\n\"Yar\u0131n kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 m\u00fcmk\u00fcn olamayaca\u011f\u0131m; toplant\u0131y\u0131 ba\u015fka bir tarihe ertelemek m\u00fcmk\u00fcn m\u00fcd\u00fcr?\"\n\nAlternatif olarak, e-posta veya resmi yaz\u0131\u015fma i\u00e7in \u015fu \u015fekilde de ifade edilebilir:\n\n\"Yar\u0131n kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 m\u00fcmk\u00fcn olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan, toplant\u0131y\u0131 farkl\u0131 bir tarihe ertelemek talep ediyorum.\"<|im_end|>"]}
